internal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json:3026:      "gap": "ErrInvalidScalar is the internal/scalar refusal funnel for the common wire scalars Section 1.6 declares, but its CBOR decoder clauses, its UTF-16 ordering derivation clause and its wall-clock-ownership clause have no implementation, and no clause of Section 1.6 is enumerated against an acceptance case."
